 "scope": "Formal finite count and actual instance; hand architecture-specific asymptotics, known-witness tree probability/cost and overlapping coefficient identity. No general selector lower bound, joint construction/yield bound, complete ECDLP algorithm, measured speed, signed verification, native numerical, paid or qualification execution.",
